@startuml lld-us2-sequence
title LLD-US2 Confirm login with an OTP: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant AuthService
participant OtpService
participant SmsGateway
AuthService -> OtpService : send(mobile)
OtpService -> SmsGateway : send(OTP)
Browser -> AuthService : POST /otp/verify
AuthService -> OtpService : check(otp)
OtpService --> AuthService : valid
AuthService --> Browser : session token
@enduml